{"id":"H6889","lemma":"צֶ֫רֶת","transliteration":"tseret","sayIt":"TSE-ret","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Zereth","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.4.7;\nson of: Ashhur (H0806) and Helah (H2458);\nbrother of: Haahashtari (H0326), Izhar (H3328), Ethnan (H0869) and Koz (H6976);\nhalf-brother of: Ahuzzam (H0275), Hepher (H2660) and Temeni (H8488)\n§ Zereth = \"splendour\"\nson of Ashur, the founder of Tekoa, by his wife Helah","glosses":["zereth"],"count":1,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-4","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"were Zereth","kjv":"Zereth"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 4:7","note":"The sons of Helah were Zereth, Izhar, and Ethnan.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0275","lemma":"אֲחֻזָּם","transliteration":"achuzzam","gloss":"Ahuzzam"},{"id":"H0326","lemma":"אֲחַשְׁתָּרִי","transliteration":"achashtari","gloss":"Haahashtari"},{"id":"H0806","lemma":"אַשְׁחוּר","transliteration":"ashchur","gloss":"Ashhur"},{"id":"H0869","lemma":"אֶתְנַן","transliteration":"etnan","gloss":"Ethnan"},{"id":"H2458","lemma":"חֶלְאָה","transliteration":"chelah","gloss":"Helah"},{"id":"H2660","lemma":"חֵ֫פֶר","transliteration":"chepher","gloss":"Hepher"},{"id":"H3328","lemma":"יִצְחַר","transliteration":"yitschar","gloss":"Izhar"},{"id":"H6976","lemma":"קוֹץ","transliteration":"qots","gloss":"Koz"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}